# the ambience (1.2): the Room page's fourth knob, named for what is outside (Rain, Wind, Sea, Fire; "Ambience",
# none, on The Corner). Off up to 125 % of the preset's own air, 100 % by default, kept for each preset and saved.
# Paused (the band's tails gone), each preset's air sounds at its own level, is silent turned right down (the rainy
# ones above all), and stays clear of clipping turned right up; the screen reader says it
wait 300
listen
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
tap LFO
wait 500
said Room page: Reverb 55, Room 55, Tone 50, Ambience None
expect amb 20
spin K4 -5
wait 300
expect amb 20
wait 25000
peakreset
wait 2000
expect peak_db_max -100
shot room-corner.png
# Highland Pub: rain, 30
